#: www/index.php:20
msgid "Get your Windows license refund now!"
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:22
msgid ""
"We all know the joy of acquiring a new laptop and the excitement of "
"exploring its features and functionalities. However, the vast majority of "
"laptops are only sold with a specific proprietary operating system: "
"Microsoft Windows."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:23
msgid ""
"The vendors do not remove the Windows license, and you must pay the entire "
"price, even if you do not want to use this system."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:26
msgid "This is unfair and we want to change it!"
msgstr "Det här är inte rättvist och det vill vi ändra på!"

#: www/index.php:27
msgid ""
"Consumers should be able to buy laptops without any specific operating "
"system, and should not have to pay the license price if they don't want to."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:30
msgid "Request your refund now!"
msgstr "Begär din återbetalning nu!"

#: www/index.php:45
msgid ""
"You should not have to pay for software you don't want. Devices like laptops "
"and smartphones are general purpose computers so, they should be neutral in "
"relation to the software they run. Manufacturers and vendors should not have "
"the right to impose specific operating systems on you. When you request a "
"refund, the process should be easy, quick and straightforward. Here’s what "
"we demand:"
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:48
msgid "Do not restrict users to specific software."
msgstr "Begränsa inte användare till en specifik mjukvara."

#: www/index.php:48
msgid ""
"Device manufacturers and vendors should not impose an operating system or "
"software on consumers, and should not force them to pay for software that "
"they don't want. Laptops and smartphones are general purpose computers, so "
"consumers should be able to run the software they want on their devices."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:49
msgid "Transparent pricing."
msgstr "Transparent prissättning."

#: www/index.php:49
msgid ""
"Consumers should have the right to decline pre-installed software, including "
"the operating system, but still be able to buy the laptop without it."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:50
msgid "Hassle-free refunds."
msgstr "Problemfria återbetalningar."

#: www/index.php:50
msgid ""
"Manufacturers and vendors should clearly publish the steps for requesting "
"and obtaining a refund on their websites. The process should be simple, easy "
"and accessible to any consumer. No one should go through unnecessary or "
"complicated procedures i.e. sending the entire computer to a service centre "
"just to remove unwanted software."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:52
msgid "Take action!"
msgstr "Gör något!"

#: www/index.php:65
msgid "How to request your license refund"
msgstr "Så här begär du återbetalning för din licens"

#: www/index.php:104
msgid "Start up the PC and take pictures"
msgstr "Starta upp PC:n och ta bilder"

#: www/index.php:106
msgid ""
"Take pictures of the screen of the clauses of the contract where the "
"reimbursement is indicated or make a video by scrolling through the whole "
"contract (maybe useful later). If possible, do not format/erase yet your "
"computer storage."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:124
msgid "Contact the manufacturer's customer service"
msgstr "Kontakta tillverkarens kundtjänst"

#: www/index.php:126
msgid ""
"Contact the manufacturer by telephone or, better still, chat/email, and keep "
"the relevant correspondence. For the telephone, note the date, time and with "
"whom you spoke. For chat, copy/paste what was written."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:144
msgid "If they respond negatively..."
msgstr "Om de svarar negativt..."

#: www/index.php:146
msgid ""
"Problem Not Solved: fill-in the Refund Form and send it to the manufacturer."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:149
msgid "Fill in the Refund Form"
msgstr "Fyll i formuläret för återbetalning"

