msgid ""
"Here you can find useful material to refund the cost of the Windows "
"operating system."
msgstr ""

#: www/index.php:199
msgid "Manufacturers"
msgstr "Tillverkare"

#: www/index.php:200
msgid "Not all manufacturers and vendors are equal."
msgstr "Alla tillverkare och leverantörer är inte likadana."

#: www/index.php:200
msgid ""
"Some react differently and treat consumers better. We have a lot of "
"experience in requesting refunds, and keep track of those who respect your "
"right to choose—and those who don't. Below we provide reports on "
"manufacturers concerning their licenses and refund policies to help you in "
"getting your money back."
msgstr ""

